      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JADE CLOVER (1) was game in defeat at the latest run, finishing second and beaten 0.8 lengths (19.31) behind Kairanga at Q Straight. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from five starts. Makes plenty of appeal. HE'S DELIRIOUS (2) has a strong winning strike-rate this journey here having won two of three starts. Missed the frame latest (19.20) when fourth over 350m at Q Straight in a Grade 5. Looks well placed here and among the chances. TEA ROSE (3) has a strong overall record having three wins and eight places from 13 starts but was out of the money last time when sixth (22.49) over 390m at Q Lakeside. Best form too dangerous to ignore. Have to include. ZIPPING ALCARAZ (5) raced handy last time and scored. Sure to run well again.",
